#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A block theme for clubs, coalitions and small non-profits. Big photo mastheads with a colour overlay, a serif and sans type pairing, three-up signposts and ready-made call to action bands. Section styles, three colour palettes and four typography presets let you restyle every band from Global Styles."
msgstr ""

